    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7b5e2002",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: the_definition_of_utter_disgust_in_plain_black_and_white; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a Black man and a white woman in an intimate pose, with text overlaying the image that reads 'the definition of utter disgust' and 'in plain black and white.' The juxtaposition of the text with the image is intended to convey a message of racial disgust or contempt, implying that the Black man is inherently repulsive or undesirable. This is a hateful meme that targets Black individuals by using their race as the basis for the supposed 'definition of disgust,' which is a direct attack based on protected characteristics. The use of the phrase 'in plain black and white' is a racist trope that reduces the Black man to a monochromatic, dehumanizing image, reinforcing harmful stereotypes and racial bias. The meme is designed to provoke negative emotions and reinforce racist attitudes, making it a hateful and harmful piece of content.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_07094907"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
